{"id": "official:sentence:a72aae85-377c-4753-8d47-b221d388fbbf", "text": "这是我年轻时候住的房子。", "shortMeaning": "这是我年轻时住过的房子。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:0c7e3df8-b378-4183-998d-f4c6adc170c6", "text": "这是我度过的最好的夜晚之一。", "shortMeaning": "这是我过得最好的夜晚之一。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:b048c29b-2a25-4c55-85df-d9283c309afa", "text": "这是我所见过的最大型的构造了。", "shortMeaning": "这是我见过最大的建筑物。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:760dd441-51bc-4316-a9b5-dffa05442c07", "text": "这是我所读过的最有趣的小说。", "shortMeaning": "这是我读过最有意思的小说。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:c85c1ad6-9669-47a6-83f6-7de9a4be92b7", "text": "这是我最后一次让你为我做点事了。", "shortMeaning": "这是我最后一回让你替我做事。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:8f5f8ae2-f745-419e-a08d-ebd70801c10e", "text": "这是我最喜欢的项目。", "shortMeaning": "这些项目里我最爱这个。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:d7f39a3c-29e9-49e4-a944-842b69c3d09a", "text": "这是我来到日本以来第一次吃生鱼片。", "shortMeaning": "来日本后我头一回吃生鱼片。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:4b656825-034f-40bc-b624-7bfbd48caae9", "text": "这是我每天都用的字典。", "shortMeaning": "这是我天天用的词典。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:167a5b54-74d4-45d6-8cfa-533167d22003", "text": "这是我父亲出生的地方。", "shortMeaning": "我父亲就在这儿出生。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:1a6c3829-c527-499f-af9b-ac0c7ce0d258", "text": "这是我父亲出生的村子。", "shortMeaning": "我父亲出生在这个村子。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:1a0418e6-b1ee-4d5c-9a32-66ae81f615fe", "text": "这是我生命中最美好的一天。", "shortMeaning": "这是我一生中最好的一天。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:6b9fa37e-3c88-49c8-b9ae-a187d0571c81", "text": "这是我的最终回答。", "shortMeaning": "这就是我最后的答复。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:706bb8ec-08ae-4eac-adef-e118fa090dad", "text": "这是我的电子邮箱。", "shortMeaning": "这是我的电子邮箱地址。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:14764299-969d-4cb9-8631-d5961a4619a0", "text": "这是我的第二句德语句子。", "shortMeaning": "这是我说的第二句德语。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:2394f5f8-864c-402e-9050-546ad891f05c", "text": "这是我的老牙脚踏车。", "shortMeaning": "这是我那辆老掉牙的自行车。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:8e109f3a-6ab6-46a3-9c2f-150a29d40fef", "text": "这是我的错，不是你的错。", "shortMeaning": "这是我的错，不怪你。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:4c57283c-f4e3-47f0-985a-535872e93d89", "text": "这是我的，那才是你的。", "shortMeaning": "这个是我的，那个才是你的。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:efd27dc7-9846-49f8-a940-3fef607ba040", "text": "这是我看过的最差劲的电影了。", "shortMeaning": "这是我看过最烂的电影。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:902790ab-4eb6-4ac2-9017-c91666c3ecae", "text": "这是我知道的最好的餐馆。", "shortMeaning": "这是我知道最好的馆子。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:9feb4546-05d5-4fd1-8b47-49e24e11909f", "text": "这是我第一次听说这种语言。", "shortMeaning": "这种语言我头一回听说。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:4b3bd33f-18be-4d4c-a891-e3881a4c3eca", "text": "这是我第一次来澳大利亚。", "shortMeaning": "这是我头一回来澳大利亚。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:97644a67-30be-4494-829e-94f58605a7a6", "text": "这是我第一次犯这样的错误。", "shortMeaning": "这样的错我是头一次犯。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
